          "text": "Témoignages: NUKU-HIVA (987) 22.10.1988 T1 NUKU-HIVA (987) 22.10.1988 T2 NUKU-HIVA (987) 22.10.1988 T4 NUKU-HIVA (987) 22.10.1988 T3",
